      "description": "yunshu_intent_layer_ratio：意图路由各层命中占比（rule/template/semantic/llm/reject + llm_low_confidence_fallback 子指标）。分母同步机制保障 ratio 总和恒 = 1.0。方案 A（推荐，排除 fallback 防稀释）：sum by(layer)(rate(yunshu_intent_layer_total{layer=~\"rule|template|semantic|llm|reject\"}[5m]))/on() sum(rate(yunshu_intent_layer_total{layer=~\"rule|template|semantic|llm|reject\"}[5m]))。详见 docs/observability/intent_routing_logging.md 方案 A/B。",
